<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef lower on good demand and mostly heavy offerings. Select and Choice rib cuts sharply lower, chuck and round cuts generally lower, and the loin cuts steady to weak.  Beef trimmings generally steady on good demand and moderate to heavy offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---------</p>
<p> 365 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
